      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, adding an per instance override to the limit would be very nice, though we'd still need a way to achieve these since iirc the in-game scaler is limited to 0.2-5m ranges.\n\nI understand the argument of wanting to let world creators choose how their world is experienced, and as defaults that's fine. \n\nBut I've disagreed with the fact worlds can arbitrarily decide how I get to be myself since the introduction of the official scaler.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
